{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128060604003-1128_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261127195645\"/><p>「里奧」迎來一歲生日。</p><p>印尼西爪哇省茂物縣的印尼野生動物園周五（27日）為印尼首隻本土出生的雄性大熊貓幼崽「里奧」，舉辦了一歲生日慶祝活動，包括大熊貓展示、棲息地擴建項目紀念碑簽署儀式等。</p><p>「里奧」去年11月27日在印尼出生，父母是旅居印尼的中國大熊貓「彩陶」和「湖春」。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T22:24:16.310549+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T22:06:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:34:47.212438+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T22:17:44.561701+00:00","content_hash":"37bab87acb4435eeceea644d46aed1931fe009e88f14551ea84f080f10469272","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}